aired model runs use identical batches and 8-token status limits, with full reports for the frozen audit subset. The checker requires task-specific structured evidence rules. Status accuracy does not establish helpfulness or autonomous recovery; natural-report scoring remains provisional."], "limitations": "Rare false-success events limit mismatch and risk analyses. A failed one-site edit does not establish that all internal interventions fail.", "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-8B", "scope": "Each model is separate; families are the independent units. No best test layer/model was selected."}], "cross_model_claim": "Only one model completed; no cross-model confirmation.", "natural_report_limitation": "Automatic natural-language flags are provisional, not human annotations."}, "event": "conclusions", "utc": "2026-10-09T23:19:08.897228+00:00"}
